      "id": "s4",
      "description": "For the best performing material from s3, run simulate_resolution at multiple plate thicknesses within the 2-10 mm range (e.g., 2, 4, 6, 8, 10 mm) to map the resolution vs thickness relationship."
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "description": "If results from s4 show the optimal thickness is at a boundary, test the second-best material from s3 at key thicknesses to confirm the first choice. Otherwise, refine the thickness search around the optimum for the best material."
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "description": "Verify that the best-performing material-thickness combination satisfies the hands-on maintenance constraint (low activation), then record the final recommended absorber material and plate thickness."
    }
  ]
}
